<title>UK: Brazil's Globex prices $100 million bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Globex prices $100 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>priced, joint lead managers Bank of Boston, Banco Safra and</p>
<p>Republic New York said.</p>
<p> BORROWER    GLOBEX UTILIDADES</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     9.25 PCT  MATURITY   *13.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-UP	ISS PRICE  99.879    PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.879    SPREAD	+350 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   0.25</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT NOV 1999 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AND PUT OPTIONS ON 13.DEC.99 AND 13.DEC.01</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
